You need to change floor to round (or ceil) in your database for ID 102.
Run this SQL Update:
UPDATE ASCII_CONFIG 
SET OUTPUT_AMT_DECIMAL = '["^L\d{1,3}$|^A\d{1,3}$"][4][round]|["^S\d{1,3}$|^NXY\d{2}$"][4][ceil]'
WHERE ID = 102;

